  - RULE-SET,PayPal,🔘 防止封控
  - RULE-SET,Cryptocurrency,🔘 防止封控

  # Microsoft
  - RULE-SET,Microsoft,Ⓜ️ 微软服务

  # 国际
  - RULE-SET,Spotify,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,YouTube,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,YouTubeMusic,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,Telegram,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,Instagram,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,Twitter,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,Twitch,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,Facebook,♻️ 自选
  - RULE-SET,GitHub,♻️ 自选
